# Sensor Fusion 101 — concept overview
# Companion board to paper.md; mirrors the in-lab tour.

# ── entry ──
@ box paper "Paper →" 60,60 200x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ note legend 900,60 "colors match the lab:\ngold truth · cyan estimate\ngray odometry · pink GPS" ~small

# ── truth ──
@ box truth "true pose\n(gold car on track)" 60,260 220x110 %highlight

# ── sensors ──
@ box gps "GPS\nunbiased, noisy σ≈3m\ndies in tunnel" 400,140 240x110 %rose &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications
@ box odo "odometry\nsmooth, drifts\n(gray baseline car)" 400,290 240x110 %muted &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications
@ box lidar "lidar vs landmarks\nprecise σ≈0.5m\nneeds range" 400,440 240x110 %teal &link:./paper.md#stated-simplifications

# ── fusion ──
@ box kf "Kalman filter\nweighs by uncertainty\nK = PHᵀ(HPHᵀ+R)⁻¹" 760,215 250x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-estimator
@ box est "fused estimate\n+ 1σ disc (cyan)" 760,440 250x110 %clay &link:./paper.md#measured-results

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow truth -> gps "sensed"
@ arrow truth -> odo
@ arrow truth -> lidar
@ arrow gps -> kf "z, σ=3"
@ arrow lidar -> kf "z, σ=0.5"
@ arrow kf -> est
@ arrow odo -> est "contrast only" !dashed

# ── scenarios ──
@ note scen 60,480 """
scenarios (paper: measured results)
1 open-sky - fused 4-5x better
2 tunnel - blackout, σ breathes
3 lidar-out - GPS-only wobble
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#measured-results
